[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0421","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0421.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-2013","title":"Mozilla Netscape URL空字符注入Cookie窃取漏洞","description":"Mozilla 0.9.6 及更早版本与 Netscape 6.2 及更早版本的浏览器在处理 URL 时存在空字符注入漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造包含十六进制编码空字符（%00）后接目标域名的特制链接，诱使用户点击后，浏览器错误地将跨域 Cookie 发送给攻击者控制的服务器，导致用户 Cookie 被窃取。该漏洞无需认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，影响用户会话安全。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-2013"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:00:29Z","remediation":"升级 Mozilla 至 0.9.7 及以上版本，或升级 Netscape 至 6.2.1 及以上版本。该漏洞因浏览器未正确过滤 URL 中的 %00 空字符导致跨域 Cookie 窃取，新版已修复此问题。如无法升级，可在代理或网关层拦截包含 %00 的 URL 请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://alive.znep.com/~marcs/security/mozillacookie/demo.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-01/0270.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7973.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3925","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2002/2xxx/CVE-2002-2013.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-2013","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-2013.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-2013.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2002/2xxx/CVE-2002-2013.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-2013.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/30161b4638c37443322916a4d97a62c41686781e/2002/CVE-2002-2013.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/2xxx/CVE-2002-2013.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/2xxx/CVE-2002-2013.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-20xx/CVE-2002-2013.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0421.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0421.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0421.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0419","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0419.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1914","title":"dump 本地拒绝服务漏洞","description":"dump 0.4 b10 至 b29 版本中存在不正确的文件锁定漏洞（CWE-667）。本地攻击者可通过 flock() 系统调用锁定 /etc/dumpdates 文件，导致 dump 进程无法获取该文件的必要锁，从而阻止后续备份操作的正常执行，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需特殊权限即可触发，影响 dump 0.4 系列多个版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1914"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:00:17Z","remediation":"升级 dump 至 0.4b30 或更高版本。Red Hat 用户可安装 RHSA-2005-583 提供的更新包。临时缓解措施：限制本地非授权用户对 dump 二进制文件的执行权限，或使用文件系统 ACL 保护 /etc/dumpdates 文件不被其他用户 flock 锁定。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/283033","http://secunia.com/advisories/21520","http://support.avaya.com/elmodocs2/security/ASA-2006-156.htm","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9632.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2005-583.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5264","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2002/CVE-2002-1914.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1914.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-1914.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1914","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1914.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1914.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1914.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-1914.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/34eb3a7695e83b6a33083dbe114e8beca526a149/2002/CVE-2002-1914.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1914.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0419.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0418","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0418.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1903","title":"University of Washington Pine 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Pine 4.2.1 至 4.4.4 版本存在信息泄露漏洞。该软件在处理邮件时会将 Unix 用户名和/或用户 UID 写入 Sender: 和 X-Sender: 邮件头中，远程攻击者无需认证即可通过查看邮件头获取系统用户名等敏感信息，进而为后续针对性攻击（如密码爆破、社会工程学攻击）提供便利。攻击复杂度低，仅需网络访问即可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1903"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:00:16Z","remediation":"升级至 Pine 4.64（最终版），或在 Pine 配置中设置 `sender-leak-fix` 相关选项以禁止在邮件头中插入 Sender/X-Sender 字段；建议迁移至 Alpine（Pine 后继者，Apache 协议开源维护），Alpine 默认不泄露 Unix 用户名。如无法升级，可在 MTA 层面过滤出站邮件中包含的 Sender/X-Sender 头部信息。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/276029","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9297.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4963","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1903.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1903.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1903","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1903.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1903.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/34eb3a7695e83b6a33083dbe114e8beca526a149/2002/CVE-2002-1903.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1903.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-19xx/CVE-2002-1903.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1903.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1903.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0418.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0417","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0417.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1850","title":"Apache HTTP Server mod_cgi 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Apache HTTP Server 2.0.39 及 2.0.40 版本的 mod_cgi 模块存在死锁漏洞，当 CGI 脚本向标准错误输出（stderr）发送大量数据时，httpd 进程与 CGI 脚本之间会发生读写死锁，导致 Apache 服务挂起并持续消耗内存资源。本地用户以及可能的远程攻击者可利用此漏洞造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Apache 2.0.39 和 2.0.40 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1850"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T22:00:10Z","remediation":"升级 Apache HTTP Server 至 2.0.43 或更高版本，该版本修复了 mod_cgi 中 CGI 脚本向 stderr 输出大量数据导致 httpd 与 CGI 进程间读写死锁的问题。如无法升级，可在 httpd.conf 中限制 CGI 脚本资源使用（RLimitMEM 和 RLimitCPU），或禁用不必要的 CGI 功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://cvs.apache.org/viewcvs.cgi/httpd-2.0/modules/generators/mod_cgi.c?r1=1.148.2.7&r2=1.148.2.8","http://issues.apache.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=10515","http://issues.apache.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=22030","http://marc.info/?l=apache-httpd-dev&m=103291952019514&w=2","http://seclists.org/bugtraq/2002/Sep/0253.html","http://securitytracker.com/id?1007823","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10200.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5787","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/8725","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21854","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1850.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1850","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1850.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1850.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/34eb3a7695e83b6a33083dbe114e8beca526a149/2002/CVE-2002-1850.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1850.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1850.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1850.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1850.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-18xx/CVE-2002-1850.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0417.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0417.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0417.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0414","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0414.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1650","title":"SquirrelMail 拼写检查插件远程代码执行漏洞","description":"SquirrelMail 1.2.3 之前版本的拼写检查插件（check_me.mod.php）存在命令注入漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过构造特制的 sqspell_command 参数向服务器注入并执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本 SquirrelMail 的 Web 邮件系统，可导致服务器敏感信息泄露、数据篡改或服务中断，危害严重。攻击者只需向目标发送恶意 HTTP 请求即可触发。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1650"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:43Z","remediation":"升级 SquirrelMail 至 1.2.3 或更高版本，该版本修复了 check_me.mod.php 中 sqspell_command 参数未正确过滤导致的命令注入问题。如无法升级，可在 Web 服务器层面禁用 check_me.mod.php 的访问权限，或限制 sqspell_command 参数仅允许预定义的安全值。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-01/0296.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-01/0306.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7990","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1650.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1650.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1650","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1650.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1650.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/14d874e761633e61e3b45458431a87e35478bd2b/2002/CVE-2002-1650.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-16xx/CVE-2002-1650.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1650.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1650.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1650.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0414.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0414.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0414.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0413","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0413.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1649","title":"SquirrelMail SquirrelMail 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"SquirrelMail 1.2.3 之前版本的 read_body.php 存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过在 IMG 标签中嵌入 javascript: 协议的 URL，在用户浏览邮件时触发恶意 JavaScript 代码执行。攻击者无需身份认证，仅需向目标用户发送包含恶意构造 HTML 内容的邮件即可完成攻击。该漏洞可导致会话劫持、敏感信息窃取等危害，影响所有运行 SquirrelMail 1.2.3 之前版本的服务器。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1649"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:43Z","remediation":"升级 SquirrelMail 至 1.2.3 或更高版本，该版本修复了 read_body.php 中对 IMG 标签中 javascript: URL 的过滤缺失问题。如无法升级，可在 Web 服务器层（如 Apache/Nginx）配置输入过滤规则，拦截包含 `javascript:` 协议的请求参数。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-01/0310.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/153043","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3956","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7989","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1649.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1649.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1649","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1649.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1649.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/14d874e761633e61e3b45458431a87e35478bd2b/2002/CVE-2002-1649.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-16xx/CVE-2002-1649.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1649.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1649.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1649.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0413.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0413.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0413.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0411","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0411.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1648","title":"SquirrelMail compose.php 跨站请求伪造漏洞","description":"SquirrelMail 1.2.3 之前版本的 compose.php 存在跨站请求伪造（CSRF）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造包含恶意 IMG 标签的 HTML 邮件或网页，诱使已登录 SquirrelMail 的用户访问，从而在用户不知情的情况下以该用户的身份发送邮件。攻击者可任意修改 send_to 和 subject 参数，实现冒充他人发送垃圾邮件或钓鱼邮件。该漏洞利用条件低，仅需用户点击恶意链接即可触发，影响所有使用 SquirrelMail 1.2.3 之前版本的 Web 邮件系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1648"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:43Z","remediation":"升级 SquirrelMail 至 1.2.3 或更高版本，该版本修复了 compose.php 中缺少 CSRF 令牌的问题。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）层面配置 Referer 检查，拒绝非本站来源对 compose.php 的请求，并启用 CSRF 防护插件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-01/0310.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/153043","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3956","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7989","