handling 漏洞。Red Hat 用户可安装 RHSA-2002:205 或 RHSA-2002:206 提供的更新内核 RPM 包。如无法立即升级，可卸载 pcilynx 内核模块（rmmod pcilynx）或在内核引导参数中禁用 FireWire 支持作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://linux.bkbits.net:8080/linux-2.4/cset%403d6aadcbBIDX67Zl6zZnVKRcsilCVQ","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-205.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-206.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1573.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1573","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1573.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e615d840f21a506ab4861678584a0f621d55a0d3/2002/CVE-2002-1573.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1573.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1573.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1573.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1573.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1573.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2002-1573.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0406.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0403","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0403.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1572","title":"Linux kernel bttv 驱动带符号整数溢出漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 2.4.20 之前版本的 bttv 驱动（bttv-driver.c）中 bttv_read 函数存在带符号整数溢出漏洞。攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制数据触发该漏洞，导致内核内存破坏，可能造成拒绝服务或权限提升。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响 Linux 内核版本的系统，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。由于无需认证即可远程利用，建议用户尽快升级至 2.4.20 及以上版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1572"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:34Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至 2.4.20 或更高版本，该漏洞已在 2.4.20 中修复。Red Hat Linux 用户请安装 RHSA-2002:205 和 RHSA-2002:206 提供的更新内核 RPM 包。如无法升级内核，可通过模块黑名单禁用 bttv 驱动（在 /etc/modprobe.d/ 中添加 blacklist bttv），阻止攻击者通过该驱动进行利用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://linux.bkbits.net:8080/linux-2.4/cset%403d6badc0mxsPaOTT_GuPVxCp1_ormw","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-205.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-206.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1572.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1572","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1572.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e615d840f21a506ab4861678584a0f621d55a0d3/2002/CVE-2002-1572.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1572.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1572.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1572.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1572.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1572.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2002-1572.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0403.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0401","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0401.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1571","title":"Linux Kernel 2.4 处理器 SSE 寄存器信息泄露漏洞","description":"Linux 2.4 内核（版本低于 2.4.19）在处理浮点上下文切换时错误地假设 `fninit` 指令会清除所有寄存器，但部分处理器在执行该指令后并不会清除 SSE 相关寄存器的残留数据。本地攻击者可利用此缺陷，通过精心构造的程序读取其他进程遗留的敏感信息，导致内核信息泄露。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需特殊权限即可利用，影响所有使用受影响内核版本的 Linux 系统。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1571"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:34Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 2.4.19 或更高版本，该版本修复了 fninit 指令未完全清除 SSE 寄存器导致的信息泄露问题。如无法立即升级内核，可通过禁用内核中对 SSE/SSE2 寄存器的用户态访问权限作为临时缓解措施，但建议优先完成内核升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://linux.bkbits.net:8080/linux-2.4/diffs/arch/i386/kernel/i387.c%401.6","http://search.luky.org/linux-kernel.2002/msg24003.html","http://search.luky.org/linux-kernel.2002/msg24992.html","http://www.cs.helsinki.fi/linux/linux-kernel/2002-15/0628.html","http://www.cs.helsinki.fi/linux/linux-kernel/2002-15/0760.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1571.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1571","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1571.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e615d840f21a506ab4861678584a0f621d55a0d3/2002/CVE-2002-1571.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1571.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1571.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1571.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1571.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2002-1571.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-15xx/CVE-2002-1571.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0401.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0108","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0108.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1697","title":"VTun VTun 2.0-2.5 ECB模式弱加密信息泄露漏洞","description":"VTun 2.0 至 2.5 版本使用电子密码本（ECB）模式加密，该模式采用弱加密算法导致相同明文块产生相同密文块，远程攻击者可通过分析密文模式推断明文内容，从而窃取敏感信息。该漏洞影响 VTun 2.0 至 2.5 所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.5（高危），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需权限和用户交互，机密性影响高。攻击者仅需拦截或监听加密隧道流量，通过分析相同密文块模式即可推断明文内容，无需特殊权限或用户交互即可实施被动窃听攻击获取敏感数据。VTun 官方已在后续版本中修复该弱加密模式问题，建议升级至修复版本或改用更安全的加密模式（如 CBC、CTR 等）。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1697"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:48Z","remediation":"升级到 VTun 2.6 或更高版本，停止使用 ECB 模式加密；如果无法立即升级，请修改配置文件将加密模式改为 CBC 或指定更安全的算法；同时限制网络访问权限以防止远程攻击者获取敏感信息。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/bugtraq/2002/Jan/0119.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3845","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7904","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c72b537371947a8374cf9848353741736f9e49d/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1697.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1697","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1697.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bae3e1da022eb7a639aee03446096716b0c4798f/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1697.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qf69-w3gw-8mx3/GHSA-qf69-w3gw-8mx3.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_400_500.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1697.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--59a5bb82-4312-4537-9408-1f2e2ffc7e9d.json","https://github.com/AlvaroAFdez/Puesta-en-Produccion-Segura-Ciberseguridad/blob/51447ea79c54959529f059e08c13f187be916dd7/labs/L4/README_L4.md","https://github.com/ws-researcher/CAEA/blob/098ddb07c83845feda3d1b1d56ef634927954af4/KGA/dataSet/ICNS/entN_ids_1"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0108.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0107","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0107.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1653","title":"Farm9 Cryptcat 加密连接绕过漏洞","description":"Farm9 Cryptcat 是一款支持加密的网络工具，当其以服务器模式配合 `-e` 参数启动时存在设计缺陷，未能按预期启用加密功能。这导致客户端与服务器之间的通信实际以明文传输，违背了加密配置的安全意图。攻击者可通过网络嗅探方式窃听通信链路，获取传输中的敏感信息（如口令、会话令牌等）。攻击条件简单，只需攻击者能够访问通信链路即可实施，无需认证，属中等危害等级的信息泄露漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1653"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:43Z","remediation":"建议立即停止使用 cryptcat 服务端模式的 -e 加密选项，改用 SSH、stunnel 或 TLS 隧道等成熟加密工具替代。如必须使用 cryptcat，请升级至社区维护版本（如 cryptcat 1.10+）或改用 netcat 配合 OpenSSL 实现加密通信。若无法替换，请在网络层面部署 IPsec/VPN 隔离通信链路，禁止明文端口直接暴露公网。建议升级至 cryptcat 1.10 版本或使用 netcat-openbsd 配合 stunnel 实现加密传输，并在防火墙层面限制仅允许加密隧道端口通信。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/165099","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/8431","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10618","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1653.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1653","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1653.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bae3e1da022eb7a639aee03446096716b0c4798f/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1653.json","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2002/CVE-2002-1653","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rw3w-c7r4-m22q/GHSA-rw3w-c7r4-m22q.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1653.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_149600_149700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--1834f0b3-2885-45cd-a58c-0835106c1431.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--1834f0b3-2885-45cd-a58c-0835106c1431.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0107.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0357","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0357.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1363","title":"libpng PNG库 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Portable Network Graphics（PNG）图像处理库 libpng 1.2.5 及更早版本在计算 PNG 图像行缓冲区偏移量时存在缺陷，导致缓冲区溢出。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可构造特制的 PNG 图像文件，利用该漏洞向目标系统发送恶意图片，触发 libpng 库中的缓冲区溢出，从而造成应用程序崩溃（拒绝服务），并在特定条件下可能执行任意代码。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本 libpng 库的应用程序及操作系统组件，攻击者无需任何认证即可通过网络发起攻击，利用方式简单，危害较大。libpng 开发团队已在后续版本中修复该偏移量计算问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1363"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-26T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:10Z","remediation":"` tags.<value>升级 libpng 至 1.2.6 或更高版本，建议使用最新的 1.6.x 稳定分支（当前为 1.6.58）。对于使用 libpng 的应用程序，重新编译并链接到修复后的库。如无法立即升级，可临时限制对不受信任 PNG 文件的访问，或使用 pngcheck 等工具对上传的 PNG 图像进行验证，拒绝处理包含畸形行数据的图像。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://frontal2.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:008","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-213","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2004:063","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2003_004_libpng.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-006.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-007.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-119.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-157.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2004-249.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2004-402.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6431","https://bugzilla.fedora.us/show_bug.cgi?id=1943","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10925","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A3657","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a8a162b0898524b5cf79dbbcc4c17a9c8ca1960a/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1363.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1363","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/43b3566a7a8a36e5b72f371cb23799b1115f7f78/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1363.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c22f4d895bb96cc596a627af8280a63e96ae16cd/2002/CVE-2002-1363.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1363.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1363.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1363.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/a36f4d76cddb1767f6fb47db88b804871b726290/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1363.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1363.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/99a2d0f359c44d8b27ea5e35eaa72ec2eb0f3016/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-13xx/CVE-2002-1363.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0357.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0083","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0083.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1383","title":"CUPS 整数溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Common Unix Printing System (CUPS) 1.1.14 至 1.1.17 版本存在多处整数溢出漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 CUPSd HTTP 接口发送特制请求，或通过 CUPS 过滤器中的图像处理代码触发整数溢出，导致堆缓冲区溢出，最终实现远程代码执行。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 10.0，攻击复杂度低且无需认证，可完全控制目标系统，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1383"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-26T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:13Z","remediation":"立即升级 CUPS 至 1.1.18 或更高版本。Red Hat 用户请安装 RHSA-2002:295 提供的更新包；SuSE Linux 用户应用 SuSE Security Advisory 2003-002 补丁。如无法升级，可在 CUPS 配置文件中禁用远程打印服务（注释掉 Listen 0.0.0.0:631 行，仅监听本地），并在防火墙阻断 631/tcp 端口的外部访问作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q4/0117.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104032149026670&w=2","http://secunia.com/advisories/7756/","http://secunia.com/advisories/7794","http://secunia.com/advisories/7803","http://secunia.com/advisories/7843","http://secunia.com/advisories/7858","http://secunia.com/advisories/7907","http://secunia.com/advisories/7913/","http://secunia.com/advisories/8080/","http://secunia.com/advisories/9325/","http://www.idefense.com/advisory/12.19.02.txt","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2003_002_cups.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-295.html","https://github.com/trickest/cv